title: "stkcraft-geocalc: NAIF/SPICE-aligned geometry in Rust"
abstract: >-
  Rust ephemeris, reference-frame, attitude, surface geometry and event-search
  calculations, with independent CSPICE N0067 references and an optional MCP
  server. Versioned implementation checkpoints do not claim complete
  WebGeocalc option-level certification.
